sequenceDiagram
    participant Admin as Platform Admin
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant HPA as HPA / KEDA<br/>External Metric
    participant WVA as WVA Controller Manager
    participant SatEng as Saturation Engine
    participant SFZEng as Scale-from-Zero Engine
    participant Coord as Coordinator<br/>(experimental)
    participant Prom as Prometheus / Thanos<br/>443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant EPP as Gateway API EPP<br/>Pod port HTTP/HTTPS
    participant InfServ as vLLM / SGLang<br/>Inference Servers

    Note over Admin,InfServ: Flow 1: Saturation-Based Autoscaling

    InfServ->>Prom: Export metrics<br/>(KV cache, queue depth, TTFT, ITL)
    SatEng->>Prom: Query inference metrics<br/>Auth: Bearer Token (SA token)
    Prom-->>SatEng: Metric values
    SatEng->>SatEng: Run analyzers<br/>(SatV2 / QM / Throughput)
    SatEng->>SatEng: Apply optimizer pipeline<br/>(CostAware / GreedyByScore)
    SatEng->>SatEng: Store in decision cache<br/>(in-memory, namespace/VA key)
    SatEng->>WVA: Emit wva_desired_replicas
    HPA->>WVA: GET /metrics :8443<br/>Auth: Bearer Token
    WVA-->>HPA: wva_desired_replicas value
    HPA->>K8sAPI: Patch scale subresource<br/>Auth: SA token

    Note over Admin,InfServ: Flow 2: Scale-from-Zero

    EPP->>EPP: Queue pending requests<br/>(flow-control)
    SFZEng->>EPP: Scrape queue metrics<br/>Auth: Bearer Token (optional)
    EPP-->>SFZEng: Queue size / bytes
    SFZEng->>SFZEng: Detect zero-replica variant<br/>with pending requests
    SFZEng->>K8sAPI: Scale 0→1<br/>(patch scale subresource)<br/>Auth: SA token
    SFZEng->>SFZEng: Update decision cache

    Note over Admin,InfServ: Flow 3: GPU Rebalance (Coordinator)

    Coord->>Prom: Query flow-control queue metrics<br/>Auth: Bearer Token
    Prom-->>Coord: Queue depth by namespace
    Coord->>K8sAPI: Read ResourceQuota GPU capacity<br/>Auth: SA token
    K8sAPI-->>Coord: GPU quotas per namespace
    Coord->>Coord: GPU Rebalance Plugin<br/>compute fair allocation
    Coord->>K8sAPI: Patch HPA/ScaledObject maxReplicas<br/>Auth: SA token
